      "char_end": 646,
      "text": "About \n Fernway makes merino hiking socks for long-distance walkers and trail runners. Our mission is to keep walkers comfortable on every trail. \n In March 2026 Fernway launched the Trail Notes program, in which members of its community share route reports and photos on Instagram. Fernway features a different walker's Trail Notes post each week. \n Fernway partnered with the Ridge Trail Conservancy in 2025 to fund volunteer trail maintenance days, and the brand donates one percent of sock sales to the Conservancy.",
      "text_sha256": "bf985e3c93882b50f2ba839da89b27d1e8b9a7b1631646ffc4a5c92060bb74cf",
