      "char_start": 140,
      "char_end": 578,
      "text": "Outdoor brand roundup. Fernway, the merino hiking sock brand, debuted a limited-edition sock collaboration with illustrator Ana Ruiz in September 2026. The socks feature Ruiz's drawings of alpine wildflowers and sold through Fernway's own store. \n Fernway told the outlet that most of its customers are long-distance walkers who buy socks before multi-day hikes. The brand said its Trail Notes community has grown since the program began.",
