      "text": "Brands like Fernway should consider a referral program for hiking customers. You can use trail creators to reach new walkers, and it's worth testing a newsletter series about merino sock care. \n We recommend that sock brands such as Fernway should post weekly trail content on Instagram. Brands can also partner with hiking clubs, and it is worth trying giveaways for merino socks.",
